<main class="main">

<!-- COVER -->
<div class="cover" id="cover">
  <div class="cover-glow"></div>
  <div class="cover-grid"></div>
  <div class="cover-top">
    <div class="cover-badge">Confidential — Not for Distribution</div>
    <div class="cover-ref">MYAMI-INV-001<br/>Prepared: 2025<br/>Foundation Round</div>
  </div>
  <div class="cover-center">
    <div class="cover-eyebrow">Investor Overview</div>
    <div class="cover-wordmark">MY<span class="a">A</span><span class="outline">MI</span></div>
    <div class="cover-title">A <em>digital and entertainment company</em> built at the intersection of technology, media, and culture.</div>
    <p class="cover-summary">MYAMI is building the creative and cultural infrastructure for the next generation of brands — operating across four divisions: Tech, Media, Entertainment, and Wear. We are at the foundation phase, seeking strategic partners who see the same opportunity we do.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cover-bottom">
    <div class="cover-stats">
      <div class="cover-stat"><div class="cover-stat-num">4</div><div class="cover-stat-label">Divisions</div></div>
      <div class="cover-stat"><div class="cover-stat-num">$10M</div><div class="cover-stat-label">5-Year Target</div></div>
      <div class="cover-stat"><div class="cover-stat-num">3</div><div class="cover-stat-label">Phases</div></div>
      <div class="cover-stat"><div class="cover-stat-num">1</div><div class="cover-stat-label">Belief</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="cover-prepared">Prepared for: Prospective Partners<br/>Founder: Miami<br/>Handle: @myami_official</div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- THE OPPORTUNITY -->
<div class="sec reveal" id="opportunity">
  <div class="sec-label">The Opportunity</div>
  <div class="statement">Most brands with real potential stay <em>invisible.</em> Not because of talent — because of infrastructure.</div>
  <p class="bd">The gap between what a brand could be and what the world actually sees is one of the most persistent, underserved problems in the creative economy. Artists, entrepreneurs, and cultural brands everywhere are operating below their potential — not for lack of vision or drive, but for lack of the tools, strategy, and creative execution to break through.</p>
  <p class="bd"><strong>MYAMI is built to close that gap.</strong> Across four distinct divisions, we deliver the branding, technology, media, and cultural presence that ambitious brands deserve but rarely get access to — regardless of their budget or connections.</p>
  <div class="callout"><p>"Talent deserves infrastructure. <em>MYAMI builds it.</em>"</p></div>
  <div class="g3">
    <div class="card"><div class="card-label">The Problem</div><div class="card-title">Invisible Brands</div><p>Real talent, real products, real culture — buried under poor branding, no digital presence, and zero strategy. The gap between potential and visibility is enormous and systemic.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-label">The Market</div><div class="card-title">African Creative Economy</div><p>A rapidly growing ecosystem of independent creators, event organizers, artists, and entrepreneurs — underserved by traditional agencies and priced out of premium creative services.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-label">The Solution</div><div class="card-title">MYAMI</div><p>A multi-division creative and cultural company that delivers premium branding, web development, event production, and lifestyle identity — built specifically for this market.</p></div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- CORE BELIEF -->
<div class="sec reveal" id="belief">
  <div class="sec-label">Core Belief</div>
  <h2>What drives every decision MYAMI makes.</h2>
  <p class="bd">MYAMI operates from a single conviction — stated plainly at the start and held against every decision that follows. It is not a slogan. It is a standard.</p>
  <div style="font-family:var(--fd);font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--linen);line-height:1;margin:40px 0;">TALENT DESERVES<br/><span style="color:var(--gold);">INFRASTRUCTURE.</span></div>
  <p class="bd">This belief shapes what we build, who we build it for, and how we show up in every client interaction. It also defines what MYAMI is against — the gatekeeping of quality, the invisibility of genuine talent, and the mediocre creative output that dominates the space we're entering.</p>
  <div class="g4">
    <div class="card"><div class="card-label">We Believe</div><div class="card-title">Quality is not a luxury</div><p>Premium execution should not be gatekept by budget or connection.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-label">We Believe</div><div class="card-title">Culture has value</div><p>What comes from the streets and the youth carries real, lasting value.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-label">We Believe</div><div class="card-title">Versatility wins</div><p>Multi-lane brands outlast single-lane ones. MYAMI is built for the long game.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-label">We Believe</div><div class="card-title">Execution is everything</div><p>Vision without infrastructure stays a thought. We are in the business of that distance.</p></div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- DIVISIONS -->
<div class="sec reveal" id="divisions">
  <div class="sec-label">The Business</div>
  <h2>Four divisions. Four revenue streams. One world.</h2>
  <p class="bd">MYAMI is not a single-service agency. It is a <strong>creative and cultural company</strong> operating across four distinct arms — each generating its own revenue while feeding the others. The cross-pollination between divisions is where the compounding value lives.</p>

